1
00:00:00,683 --> 00:00:03,013
(Amy:)Why is nothing easy
with him?

2
00:00:03,019 --> 00:00:07,289
(Leonard:)Look, here's the thing you need
to understand about Sheldon:

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:09,760
(Leonard:)he's the worst.

4
00:00:09,759 --> 00:00:12,999
(Amy:)I prefer to think of it
as high-maintenance.

5
00:00:12,996 --> 00:00:14,926
(Leonard:)I prefer to think of myself
as five-ten,

6
00:00:14,931 --> 00:00:17,201
(Leonard:)but I still need to get
all my pants hemmed.

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,900
(Amy:)I guess I should have known
what I was getting myself into.

8
00:00:20,904 --> 00:00:22,374
(Leonard:)Don't beat yourself up.

9
00:00:22,372 --> 00:00:24,372
(Leonard:)You've never lived
with anyone before.

10
00:00:24,374 --> 00:00:26,374
(Amy:)That's true.
And you're starting out

11
00:00:26,376 --> 00:00:28,376
(Leonard:)with Sheldon Cooper.

12
00:00:28,378 --> 00:00:31,048
(Leonard:)That's like getting your first
pet and having it be--

13
00:00:31,047 --> 00:00:33,047
(Raj:)I don't know...

14
00:00:33,049 --> 00:00:36,319
(Leonard:)What's a kind of pet
that ruins your life?

15
00:00:36,319 --> 00:00:38,849
(Amy:)You're not making me
feel better.

16
00:00:38,855 --> 00:00:41,625
(Leonard:)Look, even when Penny and I
started living together,

17
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:43,354
there was a-a learning curve.

18
00:00:43,359 --> 00:00:45,989
(Leonard:)But I promise you,
it does get easier.

19
00:00:45,995 --> 00:00:47,925
(Amy:)He put a sign up in the bathroom
that says,

20
00:00:47,931 --> 00:00:51,901
"Number of days
without Amy's hair on the soap."

21
00:00:52,735 --> 00:00:54,265
(Penny:)Yeah.

22
00:00:54,270 --> 00:00:59,020
(Leonard:)My record was six.

